        {"source_id": "apple-coredata-cloudkit-sync", "locator": "Overview: natural rhythm within system event loop; generally about a minute for a local change", "support": "supports", "excerpt": null}
      ],
      "notes": "A timer should persist start, planned end, state, and revision; each device renders elapsed time locally from monotonic/wall-clock anchors."
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "w2-platform-feasibility-002",
