  "summary": "Platform verification supports a local-first native architecture but forces staging: CloudKit is history/state sync rather than live tick transport; robust blocking is privileged; EventKit and App Intents are viable opt-in integrations; on-device Foundation Models can enhance task breakdown only behind a deterministic fallback."
